① 打开 dash.cloudflare.com → Workers & Pag:
1. Open dash.cloudflare.com → Workers & Pages → Create → Worker;
2. Paste the code below as-is, then Deploy;
3. Copy the https://<name>.<account>.workers.dev it gives you;
4. Go back to "Map settings → Hall data address", enter that domain (without /rest/v1) and save.
